1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,210
Keep this straight.

2
00:00:01,210 --> 00:00:04,414
A displacement node is a pressure antinode.

3
00:00:04,414 --> 00:00:08,593
The two descriptions are always a quarter wavelength out of step.

4
00:00:08,593 --> 00:00:15,664
If a question says pressure antinode at the closed end, it means exactly the same as displacement node.

5
00:00:15,664 --> 00:00:18,906
In this lesson we always draw displacement.

